      "width": 720,
      "height": 140,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. cavecrew-investigator (Haiku / Read-only / Code Scout / Caveman Output ~65% Token Saving)\n2. cavecrew-builder      (API Default / Surgical ≤2 File Edit / Hard Scope Boundary)\n3. cavecrew-reviewer     (Haiku / Read-only Diff Audit / Actionable Findings Only)\n4. deepseek-worker      (DeepSeek-V3.2 -> Luna Fallback / Bounded Writer / Fresh Ctx)\n5. deepseek-reviewer    (DeepSeek-R1 -> Luna Fallback / Read-only High Thinking Audit)\n6. local-worker         (LM Studio Qwen3.6-27B -> DeepSeek -> Luna / Zero-Cost Simple Edits)",
